      "review_status": "release_ready",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-SER"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "先把问题改写成一个短句：本题是“未成年人占总到馆读者”，不是“总到馆读者占未成年人”，也不是新增图书占读者。先在材料中给分子和分母各画一次同样的时间标签，再写算式。",
      "record_sha256": "7b03c4c5e6e0a6bcf82ed2361afb8a13162f8dc131d6442d5b3e563dff45bc85"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-SCOPE",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：占比的两个数先对齐年份",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.data.text_material.time_range"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
